'''Imperial Diplomacy''', also known as the '''Caphiric Model''', is a political system of diplomatic and domestic relationships between [[Caphiria]] (The Imperium) and other countries on [[Sarpedon]] (Imperial States), the vast majority of which are former territories of the Imperium. The primary functions of Imperial Diplomacy are to set forth guidelines for the relationship between Caphiria, and the space states, including [[Continental Obligations]].

