The '''Government of Faneria''', formally '''The National Government of the Republic of the Fhainn''', is the national-level government of [[Faneria]]. It is organized into four primary branches and eight major administrative Offices, which are analogous to top-level bureaus or departments of government in other countries.

Faneria is formally a {{Wp|Unitary state|Unitary}} [[Cananachan Republicanism|Quaternalist]] {{Wp|Republic}}, and practices a complex balance of power that favors its head of state, the [[Directorate of the Republic of the Fhainn|Director of the Republic]]. Outside of its internal ideology, it is considered a presidential republic. The Head of Government is the [[Taesteach of the Republic]], who oversees the legislature, which is functionally a three-chambered body; however, its upper chamber is made up of members of government during their terms rather than being specifically elected for the position. Its Quaternalist ideology breaks the government into Executive, Legislative, Audit, and Fiscal branches, with the Audit and Fiscal branches differing from Romance Occidental legal traditions.{{Template:Fhainnin Politics}}


